CM_ SG_ 416 Error_DC_link_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a to high dc-link voltage";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_output_overvoltage_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a to high output voltage. Check only active if DAB is enabled. Thresholdvalue = IF(voltageCtrl or SinkMode)THEN{uOutMaxFix}ELSE{uOutMaxTargetLimit}";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_output_current_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a to high output current. Check is always active.";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_reverse_current_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a negative current during charging. Check only active if DAB is enabled and SinkMode is disabled and voltageCtrl is disabled";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_output_undervoltage_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a to low output voltage. Check only active if DAB is enabled and voltage rised over enableThreshold after startup. Thresholdvalue = IF(SinkMode)THEN{0.5*uOutMaxTargetLimit}ELSE{uOutMinFix}";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Output_Discharge_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage tried to discharge a connected battery. Check only active if DAB is enabled and SinkMode is disabled and voltageCtrl is active.";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_input_undervoltage_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a to low dc-link voltage";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_precharge_DAB "DAB Module: DAB stage is not able to reach ist precharge voltage target. Check only active if DAB is enabled and voltageCtrl is active";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_PFC_not_ready "SM Module: PFC did not get ready in time. E.g. the requested dc-link voltage was not reached.";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Loaddump_detected "DAB Module: DAB stage detected a loaddump condition. Stopping operation to avoid voltage overshoot.";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_PowGtp "TM Module: Gate driver PSU voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_External_Fan "TM Module: External fan supply voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_REF_P3V3 "TM Module: Internal REF_P3V3 voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_POW_P5V "TM Module: Internal POW_P5V voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_POW_P24V "TM Module: Internal POW_P24V voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_REF_VOFFSET "TM Module: Internal REF_VOFFSET voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Voltage_POW_P3V3 "TM Module: Internal POW_3V3 voltage is out of range";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Wrong_PU_ID "TM Module: Check only active for Sic-Stack. Power Units in Sic-Stack have wrong ID";
CM_ SG_ 416 Error_Uncontrollable_Fan "TM Module: Fan runns to fast and does not follow the target. Check only active for 1/10 Firmware";

